674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dtKrAHUq2EkQ7kNvwHmZ5xw&_nc_oc=AdpuU0oMCjcRyJVwirfD41Cs3wWDkU_bcLELe4NDvOXDU7lotg1TWNA1ZWfKr-fiUQM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGWn8Wm77yK7LJZ6KuWhOrBvucVSWQvmoRescFUN7bXbg&oe=6A804019"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KvmJbRsdEN8Q7kNvwHbAuVj&_nc_oc=AdrMYMo416ZBmSeFtRh7_W2AypxCN9Ny624cAwHCQf4rN0XnknriPzscEWlk0TthRqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFi4PYECbJ7ndWyb0b2te2CFLnm2g2lTbjqgM8pVUtHuw&oe=6A8048D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YEAAis-4-QsQ7kNvwEDbYBr&_nc_oc=AdptTtG_Llaoo4WW17-GZ3PFUtaoZzsR3GaUgJ3JsFQ1lnG5jEbcRW1AxYPV6rx4MC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGpiC2u4UdBOsLNNfkFznsuBQt8l3Yuhmpz9cU2COwfig&oe=6A8044F1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip